my $CODE = <<'END_CODE';
Hello World
END_CODE

{
    desc => q{x deletes character under cursor},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Action: `x` deletes the character under the cursor

Macro: `xt/visual/macros/delete_char_x`

**initial.png** (before):
- Line 1: `Hello World`
- Cursor at line 1, col 0 (on `H`)

Keys: `x`

**after_delete.png** (after):
- Line 1: `ello World` (`H` deleted)
- Cursor at line 1, col 0 (on `e`)
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('x');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_delete');
    },
}
